      "note": "GREENHOUSE CONTROLLER: 12 V in at J1, set the LM2596 (M1) to 5 V before connecting anything. U1 is a 5 V Pro Micro. J2 is the 12 V fan (A0, through Q1), M6 the pump relay (A2), J3 a 28BYJ-48 vent stepper (D6-D9), D2 a status LED (A3). M2 weather sensor, M3 clock and DS1 display share I2C, M4 logs to SD, M5 is Bluetooth serial."
